  first | exact @GlobalTheory.additive_poly_taylor_coeff_sub_norm_le | exact GlobalTheory.additive_poly_taylor_coeff_sub_norm_le | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.additive_poly_taylor_coeff_sub_norm_le <;> assumption)
